== what each kind of row offers ==
info:    (no menu)
project: project-file,close-project
dir:     new-file-here,new-folder-here,rename,delete
file:    open,rename,delete
off the end: (no menu)
before the start: (no menu)
== the labels ==
  open -> Open
  new-file-here -> New File here
  new-folder-here -> New Folder here
  rename -> Rename…
  delete -> Delete
  project-file -> Add project file
  close-project -> Close project
== right-click selects, it does not open ==
-> select main.bas: selected main.bas
tabs=0
== Close project refuses while something under it is unsaved ==
-> Close project: dirty main.bas
   save main.bas first
still open=1
== saved, and then it closes ==
-> Close project: project-closed Alpha
   closed Alpha — the folder is untouched
projects=0
tabs=0
selection=[]
-> Close it again: no-project
